1   indfclas  no   INDEFINITE_CLASSIFICATION     sequence   6  6  low score difference between best overall model and second best model (not in best model's subgroup)
2   unjoinbl  no   UNJOINABLE_SUBSEQ_ALIGNMENTS  sequence   1  1  inconsistent alignment of overlapping region between seed and flanking region
3   deletinn  no   DELETION_OF_NT                 feature   4  2  too large of a deletion in nucleotide-based alignment of CDS feature
4   lowsimic  no   LOW_FEATURE_SIMILARITY         feature   6  2  region overlapping annotated feature that is or matches a CDS lacks significant similarity
5   ambgnt5f  no   AMBIGUITY_AT_FEATURE_START     feature   6  3  first nucleotide of non-CDS feature is an ambiguous nucleotide
6   ambgnt3f  no   AMBIGUITY_AT_FEATURE_END       feature   6  3  final nucleotide of non-CDS feature is an ambiguous nucleotide
#-  --------  ---  ----------------------------  --------  --  -  
7   dupregin  yes  DUPLICATE_REGIONS             sequence   1  1  similarity to a model region occurs more than once
8   discontn  yes  DISCONTINUOUS_SIMILARITY      sequence   1  1  not all hits are in the same order in the sequence and the homology model
9   lowsim3s  yes  LOW_SIMILARITY_END            sequence   1  1  significant similarity not detected at 3' end of the sequence
10  peptrans  yes  PEPTIDE_TRANSLATION_PROBLEM    feature  22  2  mat_peptide may not be translated because its parent CDS has a problem
11  indf3pst  yes  INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_END      feature   1  1  protein-based alignment does not extend close enough to nucleotide-based alignment 3' endpoint
12  deletinp  yes  DELETION_OF_NT                 feature   3  2  too large of a deletion in protein-based alignment
